e money bottom line  when i say resources i mean money  coming into especially our smaller  departments and even our mid-size  department so that the training  to intervene and the training on  de-escalation  all those uh training dollars are  incredibly important  we don't need less money for the police  we need more keep your eye on this i  know you're used to  nothing getting done in washington but  senator tim scott's different and  i think if anyone can do it you can do  it senator thanks so much  thanks have a good day all right uh hi  everyone i'm brian kilmeade i want you  to do me a favor i want you to click to  subscribe to the fox news youtube page  this is the only way that i know for  sure that you're not going to miss any  great commentary any great  news bites any great interviews coming  your way on fox you can get it all here  on youtube so subscribe right now

